subagent customize:
    label: "Customization"
    description: "Set up linear relationships, Quote Member Binding, context rules for products on quote members and Enrich Quote options: explain, draft, preview, apply after approval, test."

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Follow skill:customization.
              1. Explain the best option using {!@actions.get_codey_playbook} concept context-rules, quote-member-binding, linear-relationships or enrich-quote. Check prerequisites (for context rules: ContextRulesEnabled with {!@actions.check_esm_setup} scope quoting).
              2. Draft the change for {!@actions.apply_esm_change}: contextRule (name, ruleset, product, expression, failureMessage; created inactive), contextRuleset, attributeBinding (attribute, objectClass, fieldApiName), linearRelationship (product, relatedProduct, relationshipType), enrichQuoteOption (target setting, value).
              3. Preview, explicit yes, commit. Turning a rule on is a second approved change.
              4. Test on sample members or a sample quote with {!@actions.preview_esm_price}; caches may need {!@actions.run_esm_admin_jobs} jobs catalog.
              Use only the results of the actions; keep the golden rules.
        actions:
            get_codey_playbook: @actions.get_codey_playbook
                with topic = ...
                with quoteId = ...
                with surface = "Agentforce"
            apply_esm_change: @actions.apply_esm_change
                with mode = ...
                with changeType = ...
                with target = ...
                with value = ...
                with fieldsJson = ...
                with recordId = ...
                with reason = ...
                with previewToken = ...
                with confirmProduction = ...
                with surface = "Agentforce"
            preview_esm_price: @actions.preview_esm_price
                with mode = ...
                with products = ...
                with quantity = ...
                with account = ...
                with priceList = ...
                with quoteId = ...
                with explainPlan = ...
                with proposedStepJson = ...
                with previewToken = ...
                with confirmProduction = ...
                with surface = "Agentforce"
            check_esm_setup: @actions.check_esm_setup
                with scope = ...
                with surface = "Agentforce"
            run_esm_admin_jobs: @actions.run_esm_admin_jobs
                with mode = ...
                with jobs = ...
                with jobId = ...
                with previewToken = ...
                with confirmProduction = ...
                with surface = "Agentforce"
